  "summary": "Doorkeeper is an OAuth 2 provider for Ruby on Rails / Grape. Prior to 5.9.1, Doorkeeper's OAuth token revocation flow…",
  "details": "Doorkeeper is an OAuth 2 provider for Ruby on Rails / Grape. Prior to 5.9.1, Doorkeeper's OAuth token revocation flow does not correctly authorize revocation requests when public, non-confidential clients are used, allowing tokens to be revoked without correct authorization. This issue is fixed in version 5.9.1.",
